# --- VARIABLES ---
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@roomId = 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
@organizerId = 987fcdeb-51a2-43d7-9012-3456789abcde

### 1. Get All Rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms


### 2. Get All Meetings (Should be empty initially)
GET {{baseUrl}}/meetings


### 3. Create a New Meeting
# @name createMeeting
POST {{baseUrl}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Initial Planning",
    "description": "Discussing project architecture",
    "startTime": "2026-03-10T10:00:00Z",
    "endTime": "2026-03-10T11:00:00Z",
    "organizerId": "{{organizerId}}",
    "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
    "status": "SCHEDULED"
}


### 4. Attempt to Create a Conflicting Meeting (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Overlapping Meeting",
    "description": "This should fail because it overlaps the 10:00 - 11:00 meeting",
    "startTime": "2026-03-10T10:30:00Z",
    "endTime": "2026-03-10T11:30:00Z",
    "organizerId": "{{organizerId}}",
    "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
    "status": "SCHEDULED"
}


### 5. Update the Meeting (Using ID from Step 3)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/meetings/{{createMeeting.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Initial Planning - Extended",
    "description": "Discussing project architecture and database schema",
    "startTime": "2026-03-10T10:00:00Z",
    "endTime": "2026-03-10T11:30:00Z",
    "organizerId": "{{organizerId}}",
    "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
    "status": "SCHEDULED"
}


### 6. Delete the Meeting (Using ID from Step 3)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/meetings/{{createMeeting.response.body.id}}


### 7. Verify Deletion (Should be empty again)
GET {{baseUrl}}/meetings